1
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:45,400
Chief Wei, Brother Qi.

2
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:46,760
You're here.

3
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,120
Close the door.

4
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:52,920
Have a seat.

5
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,359
Have you eaten?

6
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,319
Yes, we have.

7
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:02,680
How has your neighbor been lately?

8
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:05,879
Nothing unusual in his household trash.

9
00:02:05,879 --> 00:02:07,400
No one has come to see him, either.

10
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,599
Everything else is very routine.

11
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,960
Every day when he goes out,

12
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,439
he brings that laptop.

13
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,439
Carries it on his back.

14
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:13,599
Doesn't dare risk leaving it at home.

15
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:15,280
He never took it outside before,

16
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,560
but now it never leaves his side.

17
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:19,000
Seems he's still on guard against Jinlan and me.

18
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:20,599
We've watched him this long.

19
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:22,520
It's time to take the initiative.

20
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:23,400
Find a way to get

21
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,199
the memory card inside his laptop.

22
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,280
If the intel inside is detailed enough,

23
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:28,960
we can make the arrest.

24
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,800
Why not wait a bit longer?

25
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,080
Turn the tables.

26
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,199
Invite ourselves over for dinner.

27
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:35,960
He even takes his laptop into the shower.

28
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,520
It shows he no longer trusts you.

29
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:39,319
If not for a few mishaps earlier,

30
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,560
he would've moved out long ago.

31
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,240
If he really moves away,

32
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,360
how will you keep tabs on him?

33
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,240
That laptop never leaves his side now.

34
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,560
When do we make our move?

35
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,960
Brother Qi, what are your orders?

36
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:05,039
The meeting with Qian Xinfu is set.

37
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,120
Eight tonight.

38
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,280
Pacific Nightclub.

39
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,400
That wasn't easy.

40
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,159
All right, I'll be there on time.

41
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,400
Okay.

42
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,280
Why all the secrecy?

43
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,439
Bringing me all the way out here to talk?

44
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,039
Our company's books lately...

45
00:03:21,039 --> 00:03:22,240
have been running at a loss.

46
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,159
And I know nothing about medical equipment.

47
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:26,240
What if Lin Kanshan decides to quit?

48
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,400
What are you trying to say?

49
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,960
Are you and Lin Kanshan...

50
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,280
doing some other business on the side,

51
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,599
that I don't know about?

52
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:35,639
What do you mean?

53
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:38,080
You've been meeting him alone a lot.

54
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,400
I'm afraid you can't handle it alone.

55
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:40,560
If you need anything,

56
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,159
you can call on me.

57
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:42,240
I can help you out.

58
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,240
Just focus on tonight's job first.

59
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:53,199
Welcome.

60
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:54,879
Don't worry.

61
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:56,360
I'll make sure it's taken care of.

62
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:58,360
See you soon.

63
00:03:58,599 --> 00:03:59,039
Okay.

64
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,319
You're here.

65
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,360
Which private room tonight?

66
00:04:03,479 --> 00:04:04,280
The usual spot.

67
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,439
So, what are we drinking tonight?

68
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:07,639
Red wine or Western liquor?

69
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:09,919
Let's see what Director Qian prefers.

70
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,560
What'll we drink during dinner?

71
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,800
Premium Gaoliang, of course.

72
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,919
Then red wine to wash it down, probably.

73
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,439
By the way,

74
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,600
about the place you asked me to find...

75
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,600
Would a villa work?

76
00:04:20,639 --> 00:04:22,000
The one that leaked last time...

77
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,959
I had no idea about that.

78
00:04:22,959 --> 00:04:25,120
Otherwise, I wouldn't have recommended it.

79
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,560
This time, it's my cousin's place.

80
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,000
He lives abroad long-term anyway

81
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,000
and never comes back.

82
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,839
If you don't mind,

83
00:04:31,839 --> 00:04:33,000
give it some thought.

84
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:36,160
Let me take this call. Hold on.

85
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:40,160
Sister Xia,

86
00:04:40,319 --> 00:04:41,360
he beat me again.

87
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,279
I've moved so many times.

88
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,519
I don't know what to do anymore.

89
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:45,959
I'm so scared.

90
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:47,759
I'm afraid to go home tonight.

91
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,480
What's the point of hiding?

92
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,399
You're out in the open,

93
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:51,519
and that scumbag is in the shadows.

94
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:52,519
He's watching you every day.

95
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,439
Does moving even help?

96
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:55,360
Unless you leave here entirely, right?

97
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,279
Go to Xiamen,

98
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:57,040
or go abroad.

99
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:57,959
Can you even get away?

100
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:58,399
But...

101
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:58,920
"But" what?

102
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,160
There are no "buts."

103
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,560
You simply have nowhere to hide!

104
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:03,680
Even if you move,

105
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,480
he'll still track you down.

106
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,279
Don't you get it?

107
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:05,920
Listen to me.

108
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:06,959
Just use the Empty Fort Strategy.

109
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:08,600
What's the big deal?

110
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,120
Leave the door wide open

111
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,160
and let him in first.

112
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,279
Let's see if he even dares to enter.

113
00:05:11,279 --> 00:05:11,879
All right, all right.

114
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:12,600
See you soon.

115
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,519
Okay, so...

116
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,720
Sorry about that.

117
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,439
Where were we?

118
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:16,079
Right.

119
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,959
My cousin's place.

120
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:19,360
Check it out when you have time.

121
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,079
Let's not move for now. We'll see.

122
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,040
It's been so long since we met.

123
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,839
I missed you.

124
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,600
Brother Qi!

125
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,399
Brother Qian!

126
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:26,680
Welcome, welcome!

127
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,199
Gentlemen!

128
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,040
Hurry up, everyone!

129
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,120
Stop dragging your feet!

130
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,439
Greet the bosses!

131
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,839
Good evening, bosses!

132
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:36,759
Good evening!

133
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:38,399
Pick someone quickly, bosses.

134
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:40,199
Wait any longer and it'll be too late.

135
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,959
Come on, come over here.

136
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:42,399
Sit right next to me.

137
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:42,839
Hurry up and step forward!

138
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,720
Hello, Boss.

139
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:45,600
Brother Lin.

140
00:05:47,399 --> 00:05:48,279
Where are you from?

141
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,839
You're not bad either. Come over here.

142
00:05:52,839 --> 00:05:53,639
Sit over here.

143
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,319
Come sit on this side.

144
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,040
Squeeze in a bit.

145
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,639
Come on, come on.

146
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:56,439
Come over.

147
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:56,839
Squeeze in.

148
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,319
Come on, come on.

149
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,560
Come here, come over.

150
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,319
Sit over here.

151
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,319
Brother Qian is calling you.

152
00:06:00,319 --> 00:06:01,040
Come sit down.

153
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:01,920
Sit over here.

154
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:02,439
Come on, come on.

155
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,120
Hey, pretty lady.

156
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:03,639
Come on, come on.

157
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:04,319
Let's squeeze in.

158
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:04,680
Come on, come on.

159
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:04,920
Sit down.

160
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,040
Come here. Sit right over here.

161
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,040
Just make some room.

162
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:08,839
Boss Lin, don't run off!

163
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,000
It's too packed. Sitting here is the same.

164
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:11,959
Brother Lin.

165
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:12,839
Pick another one.

166
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,720
Come over and sit.

167
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:14,600
Tiantian, come here.

168
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,560
Brother Lin.

169
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:18,079
Brother Qi, aren't you picking one?

170
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:19,199
You pick one for me.

171
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:19,959
I'll pick for you.

172
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,759
Then I'll pick our best drinker here...

173
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:23,040
...to keep you good company today.

174
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,920
Go on, take good care of Brother Qi.

175
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,160
Hello, Boss.

176
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,759
Scoot over that way a bit.

177
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,560
Come on, let's squeeze in.

178
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,680
The rest of you can leave for now.

179
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:31,439
Wait a second.

180
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,959
Not picking one for Brother Xiao?

181
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,160
I'll keep my little brother company today.

182
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,399
Waiter, bring the drinks!

183
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:41,720
Didn't expect to bump into you that day.

184
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,839
You've got great taste.

185
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,160
Really.

186
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,439
She brings you good luck.

187
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,079
Marry her as soon as you can.

188
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,480
Let me tell you,

189
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:53,240
she's like a bird in the sky.

190
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,360
If you don't hold on tight, she'll fly away.

191
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,240
Sister Xia,

192
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,160
you can read faces?

193
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,800
Boss Wen loves looking into that stuff.

194
00:07:00,399 --> 00:07:02,519
It's just like attending classes.

195
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:04,120
When you hear it enough,

196
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:05,839
you naturally pick up a few things.

197
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,240
Really, trust me.

198
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:10,399
Come on.

199
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:11,680
Brother Qian,

200
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:13,519
what was your favorite song called again?

201
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,399
"Fight to Win."

202
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,279
Right, right, right.

203
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,199
Come sit down and drink.

204
00:07:17,199 --> 00:07:17,920
Sit down and drink. Have a seat.

205
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,000
Cheers.

206
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,319
I've already... I'm already here.

207
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:30,360
I'm already at Room 666.

208
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:30,759
I'm here.

209
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:33,319
Don't go! Have another drink.

210
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,480
The bags are all over there.

211
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,480
We're just waiting on you!

212
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,360
Just waiting for you.

213
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:37,959
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

214
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:39,439
Look at you, always like this.

215
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,360
What do you mean, like this?

216
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,680
You do this every single time.

217
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,079
Everyone's waiting for you.

218
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:44,279
Who are all those people over there?

219
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:44,879
Don't worry about them.

220
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,399
He does this to me every time!

221
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,959
I'm definitely taking that guy Ding down.

222
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,279
Tell me,

223
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,319
does everyone have a nemesis?

224
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,839
Hold on,

225
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:57,360
what grudge could you have against him?

226
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,680
My luck's been terrible since I met him!

227
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:01,360
Poaching my staff, stealing my projects...

228
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:03,439
He even stole the girl I was hitting on!

229
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:04,920
None of that even matters.

230
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,040
Fair competition, right?

231
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,279
If I lack ability, I can admit it.

232
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:09,639
He shouldn't play dirty behind my back!

233
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:11,079
In the past, Mayor Xie

234
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,639
always came to my place for inspections.

235
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:14,319
Now he goes over to his place every time!

236
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,319
Why?

237
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:17,519
Saying I failed environmental inspections,

238
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,560
polluting the environment.

239
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,800
I just make a few lousy dolls!

240
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,120
How much could that possibly pollute?

241
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,839
I busted my chops for over six months

242
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:25,319
just to finally get Qian Xinfu out here,

243
00:08:25,439 --> 00:08:26,399
before we could even talk real business,

244
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,480
he got pulled away by him again!

245
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,800
Then let's call him back!

246
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,600
Don't be rash.

247
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,240
Head back inside.

248
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:32,240
Let's go back.

249
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,000
Here I come, here I come!

250
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,200
Brother Qian!

251
00:08:34,639 --> 00:08:35,720
We've been waiting forever for you.

252
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:36,639
My apologies!

253
00:08:36,639 --> 00:08:37,559
That Old Ding...

254
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,759
once he gets talking, he never stops.

255
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,519
He forced so much booze down my throat.

256
00:08:41,519 --> 00:08:42,960
Pour Brother Qian a drink!

257
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,440
Fill it to the brim.

258
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,399
Fill them all up.

259
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:47,519
Nobody gets to cheat today!

260
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,639
Come on, come on!

261
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:49,799
Come on, drink up!

262
00:08:49,919 --> 00:08:50,519
Cheers!

263
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:51,919
Brother Xiao,

264
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,320
you need to take it easy.

265
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,120
Your brother-in-law told me

266
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,039
you shouldn't drink.

267
00:08:56,039 --> 00:08:56,799
He told me to watch you

268
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:57,320
and keep you from getting drunk.

269
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,960
When Wu Jinhe speaks,

270
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,399
I wouldn't dare disobey.

271
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,320
Come on, drink up! Come on.

272
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:02,600
Don't drink that!

273
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,480
I'll take it for you.

274
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,240
If he won't drink, I will.

275
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:06,879
Brother Qian,

276
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:08,720
I'm just a guy from out of town.

277
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,000
I'm not like him.

278
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,559
I don't have a brother-in-law here,

279
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,039
so I can only rely on big brothers.

280
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,480
Brother Qian, here's a toast to you.

281
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,799
You just take a sip,

282
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:16,840
and I'll finish the glass.

283
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:19,159
How about one drink for one document?

284
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:20,879
Bottoms up! Drink it down!

285
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:26,600
What?

286
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,399
No documents,

287
00:09:28,919 --> 00:09:30,679
and not even a drink?

288
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,720
Cut the crap.

289
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:37,879
He's drunk, just drunk.

290
00:09:38,159 --> 00:09:39,159
Make an apology!

291
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:40,279
Drink another, drink another!

292
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:41,559
A serious apology.

293
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:42,360
Make proper amends.

294
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:43,759
Drain it, drain it, bottoms up!

295
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:49,159
Brother Qian, Brother Qian.

296
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:51,200
Just let him drink one more.

297
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,600
In this room, besides me,

298
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,480
nobody knows

299
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,480
how much Young Boss Lin can actually drink.

300
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:56,840
Why doesn't everyone take a guess?

301
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:59,360
He can down premium sorghum and stay sober,

302
00:09:59,879 --> 00:10:01,840
and still walk a straight line.

303
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,480
How about this, Brother Qi?

304
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,200
Whoever guesses right,

305
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,080
I'll down this whole bottle.

306
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:11,120
Brother Qian guesses. Brother Qian, you go first.

307
00:10:11,679 --> 00:10:12,840
You go first, Brother Qian. Come on.

308
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,399
Boss Qian.

309
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:14,320
Sit, sit, sit.

310
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,000
Two jin?

311
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,039
Two jin.

312
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:22,080
I guess two and a half jin.

313
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,080
Your turn.

314
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,799
I guess two and a half jin too.

315
00:10:28,039 --> 00:10:29,559
I'll give you two more chances.

316
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,039
If you guess wrong,

317
00:10:31,039 --> 00:10:32,039
however much he drinks today,

318
00:10:32,039 --> 00:10:33,120
you drink just as much.

319
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,679
I can't even hold a candle

320
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:37,200
to Boss Lin's little toe!

321
00:10:37,799 --> 00:10:38,320
I...

322
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:40,080
How about I drink a penalty cup?

323
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,679
Two chances.

324
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,720
First try.

325
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:46,840
I really can't guess.

326
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,679
One chance left.

327
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:48,600
How much is it?

328
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,120
Guess wrong,

329
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:00,879
you drink.

330
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,799
Guess right,

331
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:03,440
he drinks.

332
00:11:14,759 --> 00:11:15,879
My personal record:

333
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,799
four catties of premium sorghum.

334
00:11:18,679 --> 00:11:20,240
It won't be easy to get me drunk.

335
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,159
I'm asking her.

336
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:21,960
Did I ask you?

337
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,759
I'm talking to her.

338
00:11:22,919 --> 00:11:23,759
Was I talking to you?

339
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:24,840
What are you two doing?

340
00:11:25,639 --> 00:11:26,960
Both of you are drunk.

341
00:11:33,679 --> 00:11:34,480
Is this bottle better,

342
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:35,840
or is this one?

343
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:36,600
Both are good.

344
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,840
Don't give me that bullshit.

345
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,240
Pick one.

346
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,360
Which is better? Tell me!

347
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,679
Not you. You tell me.

348
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,559
I'm talking to you! Cat got your tongue?

349
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:45,159
Who's been missing me?

350
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,159
Three penalty drinks!

351
00:11:46,159 --> 00:11:47,080
Come on, fill mine!

352
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,360
Sweetheart, pour me a drink.

353
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:50,639
Let me have a drink with Brother Ma first.

354
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:51,559
Coming, coming!

355
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,320
Drinking's all about having a good time.

356
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,039
Here!

357
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,200
Brother Qi, here's to you.

358
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,120
All right.

359
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,320
If it's a toast, make it a double.

360
00:12:07,799 --> 00:12:08,440
All right.

361
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:31,080
Finished.

362
00:12:31,279 --> 00:12:32,200
Which one tastes better?

363
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,759
Anything Brother Qi pours tastes good.

364
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,639
Then keep drinking.

365
00:12:40,039 --> 00:12:41,320
Drink until you can tell them apart.

366
00:12:41,399 --> 00:12:42,879
What's wrong with you today?

367
00:12:43,279 --> 00:12:44,960
Of course I want to drink with you.

368
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:45,799
Right?

369
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:46,399
Look, brother,

370
00:12:46,679 --> 00:12:47,440
come with me.

371
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,559
Let's drink by ourselves.

372
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:49,759
I'll take good care of you. Let's go.

373
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:51,039
Who are you acting like a big sister to?

374
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:53,360
Drink alone with you?

375
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,279
Who the hell do you think you are?

376
00:12:56,159 --> 00:12:57,440
Since you can't tell which is better,

377
00:12:57,679 --> 00:12:59,480
let's see which one's sturdier.

378
00:13:03,759 --> 00:13:05,399
Brother Ma, what are you doing?

379
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,120
Don't smash it on the floor.

380
00:13:07,159 --> 00:13:08,200
Smash it right here!

381
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,279
What are you trying to say?

382
00:13:09,279 --> 00:13:10,320
Trying to play the hero here?

383
00:13:10,399 --> 00:13:12,039
Got guts? Take it out on the officials!

384
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:14,000
Are you two picking on me?

385
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:15,279
Walking all over me?

386
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:16,279
Think you're the only one with a temper?

387
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:17,080
You think I don't have one?

388
00:13:17,399 --> 00:13:19,120
Getting me drunk so I look like a clown...

389
00:13:19,159 --> 00:13:20,120
Think they'll just hand you the document?

390
00:13:20,519 --> 00:13:21,480
Stop targeting your hospital?

391
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,600
Stop fining you?

392
00:13:22,639 --> 00:13:24,000
They have you pinned with one document,

393
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,120
and won't give it to you. So what?

394
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,600
Yet you two still drink every single day.

395
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:27,799
What damn good does that do?

396
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:29,639
You...

397
00:13:29,679 --> 00:13:31,120
You're taking shots at me, aren't you?

398
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:31,679
Let's go.

399
00:13:31,679 --> 00:13:32,039
President Qian.

400
00:13:32,039 --> 00:13:33,200
Don't you regret this.

401
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:33,639
Let's go.

402
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:35,000
At worst, we just don't do business!

403
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:35,679
So what?

404
00:13:35,679 --> 00:13:36,440
What did you just say?

405
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,399
At worst, we just don't do business!

406
00:13:37,799 --> 00:13:38,919
Look at what he's saying!

407
00:13:38,919 --> 00:13:39,919
All right, it's just a misunderstanding.

408
00:13:39,919 --> 00:13:40,519
Let's go.

409
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:41,399
Who's leaving?

410
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,679
Whoever leaves, I'll mess them up!

411
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:43,960
What are you looking at?

412
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,879
I'm talking to you!

413
00:13:45,039 --> 00:13:45,799
Yell at Brother Qi again,

414
00:13:45,799 --> 00:13:46,600
and I'll beat you up too!

415
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,320
There's a restroom inside.

416
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,600
Why come outside to pee?

417
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:06,159
Qian Xinfu threw up all over the restroom.

418
00:14:06,159 --> 00:14:08,000
You can't even step in there.

419
00:14:09,799 --> 00:14:10,759
My acting was so convincing,

420
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,240
I almost bought it myself.

421
00:14:13,399 --> 00:14:14,399
How was that, Brother Qi?

422
00:14:14,519 --> 00:14:16,120
Did I pull it off back there?

423
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,559
Were you even acting?

424
00:14:17,559 --> 00:14:18,960
It looked pretty real to me.

425
00:14:19,519 --> 00:14:20,240
Really?

426
00:14:22,639 --> 00:14:25,080
Maybe I'm just too stressed and exhausted.

427
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,679
Running a factory is no job for a human.

428
00:14:28,879 --> 00:14:30,279
If we didn't push him like that,

429
00:14:30,279 --> 00:14:31,600
he would never stamp your papers,

430
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,679
and he'd slap us with a huge fine.

431
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,000
You can't just give him sweet treats;

432
00:14:34,159 --> 00:14:35,679
you have to knock him down a peg sometimes.

433
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:37,519
They can't treat entrepreneurs like dirt.

434
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:41,200
Why aren't you guys coughing?

435
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,200
Cough for what?

436
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,240
Haven't you heard?

437
00:14:44,919 --> 00:14:46,480
If you pee outside at night,

438
00:14:46,559 --> 00:14:47,759
you're supposed to cough

439
00:14:47,759 --> 00:14:49,960
to alert passing spirits and gods,

440
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,080
asking them to look away.

441
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,360
That's actually a thing?

442
00:14:58,519 --> 00:14:59,919
Amitabha, Amitabha.

443
00:14:59,919 --> 00:15:01,679
Not too late to warn them now, right?

444
00:15:02,919 --> 00:15:05,120
Brother Qi, do you not believe in this?

445
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:06,840
Have you ever had your fortune told?

446
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,519
Once starts a hundred times. No.

447
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:11,840
Even a hundred times wouldn't be enough.

448
00:15:12,279 --> 00:15:13,320
It's so dark.

449
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,759
Shouldn't someone show you the way?

450
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:17,000
Do you know any fortune-tellers?

451
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:17,759
Let's go together.

452
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,679
Sister Xia said Boss Wen seems to know how.

453
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:22,799
Him?

454
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,360
Drink some tea to sober up.

455
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:26,320
Boss Lin.

456
00:15:26,639 --> 00:15:28,200
You came all the way to a nightclub,

457
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,519
so why carry a laptop bag?

458
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,559
My life's work, my treasures...

459
00:15:31,559 --> 00:15:32,639
they're all inside.

460
00:15:32,799 --> 00:15:33,600
Treasures?

461
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:34,600
Then I must take a look.

462
00:15:34,759 --> 00:15:35,519
You can't see it.

463
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,519
Never flaunt your wealth. Keep it hidden.

464
00:15:37,519 --> 00:15:37,960
It's all...

465
00:15:38,759 --> 00:15:39,240
Done.

466
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:39,799
Finished writing.

467
00:15:39,799 --> 00:15:40,120
Come on over.

468
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:41,279
Take a look, take a look, take a look.

469
00:15:43,759 --> 00:15:44,480
This one is yours.

470
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:47,639
Brother Wen,

471
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:48,840
what fine calligraphy!

472
00:15:49,159 --> 00:15:51,440
Flowing rapids bear no intent,

473
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,200
"White clouds emerge"

474
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:53,600
"from the peaks..."

475
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,399
"Emerge from the peaks."

476
00:15:54,399 --> 00:15:56,440
White clouds drift from peaks without aim.

477
00:15:57,679 --> 00:15:58,320
What does that mean?

478
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:00,000
That's just its literal meaning.

479
00:16:00,159 --> 00:16:01,000
This is character divination,

480
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:01,879
not poetry analysis.

481
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,720
I don't really know what it means either.

482
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:06,840
Anyway, this phrase is in your birth chart.

483
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,679
My skills are limited.

484
00:16:08,679 --> 00:16:09,720
That's as far as I can interpret.

485
00:16:10,519 --> 00:16:10,879
All right.

486
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:11,679
Boss Wen,

487
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:12,519
what about mine?

488
00:16:12,759 --> 00:16:13,360
Yours?

489
00:16:13,519 --> 00:16:14,320
Yours is simple.

490
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,600
A long, arduous journey.

491
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,759
Brother, you're destined for a life of toil.

492
00:16:17,919 --> 00:16:19,840
Still, a life of toil isn't all bad.

493
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,000
You make money, after all.

494
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,279
I actually wanted this calligraphy.

495
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:24,960
Eight thousand miles of clouds and moon.

496
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,840
As long as it doesn't end in vain sorrow.

497
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:28,960
Brother Qi's...

498
00:16:29,159 --> 00:16:30,080
Brother Qi's here is...

499
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:31,320
Brother Qi.

500
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,000
Let me see.

501
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:32,960
Yours.

502
00:16:35,519 --> 00:16:37,720
In youth, proud of a cloud-reaching brush.

503
00:16:38,919 --> 00:16:40,200
That sounds pretty good.

504
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,440
Can I trade with him?

505
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,879
Think you're picking nightclub hostesses?

506
00:16:42,879 --> 00:16:43,639
You think you can pick and choose?

507
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:45,960
Better to pick from Boss Wen's liquor.

508
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,559
He actually prepared some.

509
00:16:49,279 --> 00:16:50,360
This, this, and this.

510
00:16:50,639 --> 00:16:52,279
Everyone take a bottle home.

511
00:16:52,279 --> 00:16:55,080
Drink it, and you'll sleep soundly.

512
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:56,799
Is it really that magical?

513
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:57,960
There's more, there's more.

514
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,320
This one here...

515
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:00,840
I...

516
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:02,240
I steeped it for three years.

517
00:17:02,679 --> 00:17:04,599
The essence of heaven and earth.

518
00:17:04,799 --> 00:17:05,240
Look at this.

519
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,680
You really ought to taste this.

520
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,279
Got to taste the essence.

521
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,160
What's wrong?

522
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:14,119
Your hands were faster than my mouth.

523
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:16,200
I didn't mean for you to taste it now.

524
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,519
Should we get a bed ready for him or what?

525
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,839
What are you guys talking about?

526
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,359
Still putting on an act?

527
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,119
As if I don't know your tolerance.

528
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:31,640
Drunk off a single plum?

529
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:32,519
Impossible.

530
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:35,559
President Lin.

531
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,559
Brother Shan.

532
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:03,359
I knew you weren't drunk.

533
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,200
Come on.

534
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,599
Let's go down and keep drinking.

535
00:18:07,359 --> 00:18:08,119
Brother.

536
00:18:10,079 --> 00:18:10,839
Brother.

537
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:18,559
Too slow.

538
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:06,359
Mr. Ma.

539
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:08,519
H-Have you seen my boss?

540
00:19:09,319 --> 00:19:10,960
Had too much to drink. Lying in the back.

541
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:13,759
Boss.

542
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,759
Squabbles aside,

543
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:17,000
brothers are still brothers.

544
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:19,079
I was going to take him home,

545
00:19:19,079 --> 00:19:20,440
but since you're here, you take him back.

546
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:21,960
All right.

547
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,559
Watch your head.

548
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:48,279
How is it?

549
00:19:48,799 --> 00:19:49,640
It's good.

550
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:51,440
Is it bitter?

551
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,279
I'm asking her.

552
00:20:00,279 --> 00:20:01,079
Did I ask you?

553
00:20:01,079 --> 00:20:02,039
I'm talking to her.

554
00:20:02,039 --> 00:20:03,279
Well, I'm telling you.

555
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:40,920
Get up first.

556
00:22:24,519 --> 00:22:25,359
What are you doing?

557
00:22:27,319 --> 00:22:28,119
What?

558
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:30,000
Are you crazy?

559
00:22:33,759 --> 00:22:34,559
What is it?

560
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:05,920
Why does it stink so bad?

561
00:25:07,599 --> 00:25:09,039
You threw up yesterday.

562
00:25:09,519 --> 00:25:10,920
Smelled even worse half an hour ago.

563
00:25:12,599 --> 00:25:13,559
You...

564
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:17,559
did you stay the night or just get here?

565
00:25:24,319 --> 00:25:26,000
Hand me that dry rag.

566
00:25:36,480 --> 00:25:37,680
What happened to my mouth?

567
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:38,799
Why does it hurt so much?

568
00:25:39,559 --> 00:25:41,440
Who knows where you bumped it last night.

569
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:42,480
It was like that when you got back.

570
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:49,920
Was I really that drunk last night?

571
00:25:50,559 --> 00:25:51,599
You almost drank yourself to death.

572
00:25:54,359 --> 00:25:55,559
According to Xinhua News Agency:

573
00:25:55,839 --> 00:25:58,039
A CPC Taiwan, China Work Office official

574
00:25:58,039 --> 00:26:00,359
and the State Council Taiwan, China Office

575
00:26:00,359 --> 00:26:02,759
recently issued a statement regarding

576
00:26:02,759 --> 00:26:03,799
cross-Strait political negotiations.

577
00:26:03,799 --> 00:26:04,920
The official stated that,

578
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:05,359
at present,

579
00:26:05,359 --> 00:26:07,759
thanks to joint efforts across the Strait,

580
00:26:07,759 --> 00:26:10,519
cross-Strait travel and economic exchanges

581
00:26:10,519 --> 00:26:12,319
continue to maintain growth momentum.

582
00:26:12,319 --> 00:26:13,519
Holding political negotiations

583
00:26:13,599 --> 00:26:15,640
has historically been put on the agenda.

584
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,680
One China is the consensus of the people

585
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:20,359
across the Strait and globally recognized.

586
00:26:20,480 --> 00:26:22,839
Taiwan, China compatriots are our brothers.

587
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:25,400
The interests of both sides are aligned.

588
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:28,240
Taiwan, China compatriots have a tradition

589
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:31,119
of safeguarding national reunification.

590
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,400
They love Taiwan, China,

591
00:26:32,519 --> 00:26:33,519
and they love the motherland.

592
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:35,640
They hope to improve cross-Strait relations

593
00:26:35,640 --> 00:26:38,160
and realize the "Three Direct Links" soon.

594
00:26:38,279 --> 00:26:40,079
More and more Taiwan, China compatriots...

595
00:26:40,519 --> 00:26:41,839
I haven't been this drunk in so long.

596
00:26:42,079 --> 00:26:43,400
I only had one plum.

597
00:26:43,799 --> 00:26:45,000
How did it turn out like this?

598
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:54,640
Why does my laptop smell like alcohol?

599
00:26:56,079 --> 00:26:57,559
You carried it back yourself last night.

600
00:26:57,559 --> 00:26:58,799
You wouldn't even take it off to sleep.

601
00:27:10,319 --> 00:27:11,240
Call Xiao Lu.

602
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:12,119
Tell him to come early

603
00:27:12,279 --> 00:27:13,480
and take me to get the computer fixed first.

604
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:14,359
All right.

605
00:27:23,519 --> 00:27:24,920
Why don't you head back first?

606
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:27,000
So he doesn't get the wrong idea.

607
00:27:38,920 --> 00:27:40,519
There's really nothing to misunderstand.

608
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,359
Didn't you just get here this morning?

609
00:27:43,079 --> 00:27:43,720
Isn't that right?

610
00:27:44,279 --> 00:27:45,440
Why aren't you saying anything?

611
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:05,480
As I recall,

612
00:28:06,079 --> 00:28:07,880
aren't you visiting your aunt soon?

613
00:28:12,279 --> 00:28:13,160
Find a chance

614
00:28:14,720 --> 00:28:16,200
to introduce me to your aunt.

615
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:24,359
He Chunxiao.

616
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:26,240
He Chunxiao.

617
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:29,559
The girl has left.

618
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:31,079
He should be heading out soon.

619
00:28:31,079 --> 00:28:31,799
Tell Lao Wei

620
00:28:31,799 --> 00:28:32,640
it's time to make a move.

621
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:21,240
What did you think I was going to do?

622
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:22,200
Paying your salary,

623
00:29:22,319 --> 00:29:24,160
buying plane tickets, booking hotels...

624
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:25,400
I spent all that money.

625
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:27,119
I wouldn't hire you just to mess around.

626
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:29,440
I added milk foam and sugar for you.

627
00:29:29,599 --> 00:29:30,680
It shouldn't be so bitter now.

628
00:30:38,279 --> 00:30:39,160
Hey, Auntie.

629
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:43,160
Are you still away on business?

630
00:30:45,319 --> 00:30:47,519
It's gotten cold,

631
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:50,640
I'd like to come get two thick quilts.

632
00:30:54,039 --> 00:30:55,680
Are you home today?

633
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:56,799
If you are,

634
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:58,880
I... I can come over right now.

635
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:03,039
Okay. All right, sounds good.

636
00:31:04,039 --> 00:31:04,640
Bye-bye.

637
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:38,319
Even if you move, he'll still track you down.

638
00:31:38,359 --> 00:31:39,119
Don't you know that?

639
00:31:39,319 --> 00:31:39,799
Listen to me.

640
00:31:39,799 --> 00:31:40,880
Better use the Empty Fort Strategy.

641
00:31:41,079 --> 00:31:42,079
What's the big deal?

642
00:31:42,079 --> 00:31:42,559
Leave the door open.

643
00:31:42,559 --> 00:31:43,640
Let him in first.

644
00:31:43,640 --> 00:31:44,759
Let's see if he dares to come in.

645
00:33:02,279 --> 00:33:02,799
Move!

646
00:33:34,759 --> 00:33:35,480
Boss.

647
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:38,640
I found some more things recently,

648
00:33:39,240 --> 00:33:40,480
the stuff you mentioned before.

649
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:43,279
Is it going to rain today?

650
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:46,759
No.

651
00:33:47,039 --> 00:33:48,200
The forecast didn't call for any.

652
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:53,440
Then find a place

653
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:54,440
and get the car washed.

654
00:33:54,799 --> 00:33:56,599
Going to the country with Wu Jinhe daily,

655
00:33:57,079 --> 00:33:58,720
the car is filthier than a field rat.

656
00:33:59,079 --> 00:34:00,359
I was going to wash it today,

657
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:01,759
but weren't we going to fix the computer?

658
00:34:02,119 --> 00:34:03,480
I worried running late would hold us up.

659
00:34:08,519 --> 00:34:10,440
Usually when I eat out,

660
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:13,280
wash the car, fix a watch or computer,

661
00:34:14,159 --> 00:34:16,719
I like veteran-run restaurants

662
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:17,960
and veteran car washes.

663
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:18,960
Do you know why?

664
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:22,039
Comrades are always the most dependable.

665
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:25,039
What did you say you found earlier?

666
00:34:27,719 --> 00:34:29,119
Some files from the Armed Forces Department.

667
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:31,880
You said your friend would be interested.

668
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:41,000
Here.

669
00:34:48,320 --> 00:34:49,440
The phone number is right here.

670
00:34:49,679 --> 00:34:50,719
Contact them yourself.

671
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:53,039
I don't know much about collecting.

672
00:34:53,280 --> 00:34:54,679
I just know people in the chamber

673
00:34:54,679 --> 00:34:55,920
are into that kind of thing.

674
00:34:57,039 --> 00:34:57,960
Once people get rich,

675
00:34:57,960 --> 00:35:00,039
they pick up all kinds of strange hobbies.

676
00:35:00,239 --> 00:35:01,920
Still, it's better than gambling,

677
00:35:02,119 --> 00:35:02,960
wouldn't you say?

678
00:35:09,599 --> 00:35:11,360
Eight thousand miles of clouds and moon...

679
00:35:12,599 --> 00:35:14,440
Young men shouldn't always be gambling.

680
00:35:14,920 --> 00:35:16,320
You should focus on your job.

681
00:35:17,199 --> 00:35:18,519
I won't gamble anymore, Boss.

682
00:35:33,559 --> 00:35:35,079
What's under this mat?

683
00:35:35,880 --> 00:35:37,400
Some people, under this mat,

684
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:38,440
will put a soft gummy candy.

685
00:35:38,440 --> 00:35:40,119
If someone accidentally steps on it,

686
00:35:40,119 --> 00:35:41,599
the candy gets crushed.

687
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:43,239
Brother Li also mentioned during training

688
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,880
that some people scatter fluorescent powder.

689
00:35:45,119 --> 00:35:45,920
If the door opens too wide,

690
00:35:45,920 --> 00:35:47,360
whoever scattered it will know.

691
00:35:51,119 --> 00:35:52,199
Look at you, connecting the dots.

692
00:35:52,199 --> 00:35:53,519
You could go for a doctorate next month.

693
00:35:53,719 --> 00:35:55,719
Yet there's no trap under the mat,

694
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:57,079
nor anywhere in the room.

695
00:35:57,159 --> 00:35:58,760
Did he carelessly forget,

696
00:35:58,760 --> 00:36:00,639
or was he sure no one would come today?

697
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:07,519
What can looking at shoes tell you?

698
00:36:07,519 --> 00:36:09,320
More sneakers and fewer leather shoes

699
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:10,679
means he's a field operative.

700
00:36:10,679 --> 00:36:12,039
With enough experience,

701
00:36:12,039 --> 00:36:13,280
from a single pair of shoes,

702
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:16,400
you can deduce their identity, job, height,

703
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:17,119
and even their looks.

704
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:19,159
Looking at shoes tells you their looks?

705
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:20,039
Are you fortune-telling?

706
00:36:20,199 --> 00:36:21,280
Out of everything I said,

707
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:22,400
only that one part was fake,

708
00:36:22,719 --> 00:36:23,880
and you chose to believe it.

709
00:36:24,079 --> 00:36:25,280
Any spy knows

710
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:26,960
when their life is on the line,

711
00:36:27,119 --> 00:36:28,280
they can't afford to be careless.

712
00:36:28,559 --> 00:36:29,800
He didn't set any cigarette ash,

713
00:36:29,960 --> 00:36:31,519
either because he's truly clean

714
00:36:31,519 --> 00:36:33,320
and meeting Cao was pure coincidence,

715
00:36:33,519 --> 00:36:34,880
or someone coached him.

716
00:36:35,039 --> 00:36:36,599
Since you already moved in next door,

717
00:36:36,599 --> 00:36:37,920
he chose to leave nothing,

718
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:38,800
facing all changes with stillness.

719
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:39,480
Brother Qi,

720
00:36:39,639 --> 00:36:40,880
last night at the Pacific,

721
00:36:40,880 --> 00:36:42,079
did you provoke him on purpose

722
00:36:42,239 --> 00:36:43,400
to test him as well?

723
00:36:45,159 --> 00:36:46,320
A trained operative

724
00:36:46,320 --> 00:36:47,719
isn't easily provoked.

725
00:36:48,679 --> 00:36:50,519
Of course, some are poorly trained.

726
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:52,719
In this field, truth and lies blur.

727
00:36:53,519 --> 00:36:54,440
Love is the same.

728
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:55,119
Happiness too.

729
00:36:55,559 --> 00:36:56,400
Sometimes,

730
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:58,360
even joy and sorrow don't belong to you.

731
00:37:02,039 --> 00:37:03,199
Stop following me around.

732
00:37:03,760 --> 00:37:05,199
Go hunt for treasure yourself.

733
00:37:06,519 --> 00:37:07,760
His computer got damp.

734
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:09,079
He'll definitely take it for repairs.

735
00:37:09,239 --> 00:37:10,320
And there's no way he'd leave

736
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,360
the memory card at home.

737
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:12,920
What should I focus on finding?

738
00:37:12,920 --> 00:37:14,039
Why don't you call him

739
00:37:14,039 --> 00:37:15,119
and ask what else is here?

740
00:37:15,760 --> 00:37:16,400
Enough.

741
00:37:25,679 --> 00:37:27,519
I have to make a living, man.

742
00:37:27,519 --> 00:37:28,559
I made a trip all the way here.

743
00:37:28,559 --> 00:37:29,880
Give me a deal. Cut the price!

744
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:31,239
For these goods, here with me,

745
00:37:31,239 --> 00:37:33,280
you won't find anywhere cheaper.

746
00:37:33,679 --> 00:37:34,199
Boss.

747
00:37:34,199 --> 00:37:35,519
Looking to buy or fix a computer?

748
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:37,800
Come take a look!

749
00:37:40,639 --> 00:37:41,639
Quit the nonsense.

750
00:37:47,760 --> 00:37:49,119
Fine, that works.

751
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:51,760
Take it. That's the price.

752
00:37:53,039 --> 00:37:53,679
Buddy.

753
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:54,639
Hello.

754
00:37:55,039 --> 00:37:56,159
Do you know how to fix computers?

755
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:56,920
Sure do.

756
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:58,159
Let me take a look.

757
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:05,159
Alright, just a second.

758
00:38:27,239 --> 00:38:27,719
Hello.

759
00:38:27,719 --> 00:38:29,599
Are you Jin Lina's guardian?

760
00:38:30,960 --> 00:38:32,480
I'm a counselor from Normal University.

761
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,760
I need to verify something with you.

762
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:35,800
Is Jin Lina currently

763
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,320
dating someone outside of school?

764
00:38:37,639 --> 00:38:38,559
And from Taiwan, China, too.

765
00:38:38,719 --> 00:38:39,880
It's just wet on the outside.

766
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:40,920
No water got inside.

767
00:38:41,119 --> 00:38:42,360
A little moisture won't hurt it.

768
00:38:42,360 --> 00:38:43,880
A quick blow-dry should fix it.

769
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:44,480
How much?

770
00:38:44,599 --> 00:38:45,079
100.

771
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:46,760
You didn't say it was this expensive.

772
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:47,719
Wasn't it 80?

773
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:49,360
I didn't even haggle.

774
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:51,599
Did a software upgrade and dust cleaning.

775
00:38:52,079 --> 00:38:53,440
Besides, we already agreed on this.

776
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:54,639
You checked out so many shops.

777
00:38:54,960 --> 00:38:56,760
I wouldn't have done it without your okay.

778
00:38:59,679 --> 00:39:00,360
All right, all right.

779
00:39:00,719 --> 00:39:01,320
Understood.

780
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:05,639
Then I'll rush back to get it.

781
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:08,639
I'll deliver it to your office before noon.

782
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:10,760
Understood, understood.

783
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,599
Okay, got it.

784
00:39:17,599 --> 00:39:18,199
Here.

785
00:39:19,599 --> 00:39:20,119
Thanks.

786
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,079
Thank you.

787
00:39:21,199 --> 00:39:22,239
All right, thanks.

788
00:39:25,039 --> 00:39:26,079
Aren't you going to check it?

789
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:28,840
Take care. Come back if you have issues.

790
00:39:29,920 --> 00:39:31,039
Where did you just go?

791
00:39:31,039 --> 00:39:31,920
Used the bathroom.

792
00:39:38,360 --> 00:39:38,880
Brother.

793
00:39:39,079 --> 00:39:40,360
Didn't get any food at the cafeteria.

794
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:41,800
I'm starving.

795
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:42,840
Headed home to eat now.

796
00:39:45,800 --> 00:39:46,440
Brother Qi.

797
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:48,239
There are so many books here.

798
00:39:48,559 --> 00:39:50,360
Which one do you think he uses as a codebook?

799
00:39:50,599 --> 00:39:51,760
Is there any pattern to it?

800
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:53,599
Didn't Instructor Wu teach you?

801
00:39:53,880 --> 00:39:55,559
Look for the book with the most wear.

802
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:56,960
A book that's read frequently

803
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:58,039
is most likely the codebook.

804
00:39:58,239 --> 00:39:59,559
If I were a spy,

805
00:39:59,920 --> 00:40:02,079
I'd avoid those patterns and rules.

806
00:40:02,079 --> 00:40:03,800
Render all their theories useless.

807
00:40:04,840 --> 00:40:05,519
Brother Qi,

808
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:06,440
tell me,

809
00:40:06,719 --> 00:40:09,280
what if he spots us near his home?

810
00:40:09,280 --> 00:40:10,000
What do we do then?

811
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,320
Once you're made,

812
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:12,320
no matter what you do to fix it,

813
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:13,519
it's completely pointless.

814
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:14,719
You'd know in your gut

815
00:40:14,719 --> 00:40:15,760
that danger is all around you.

816
00:40:16,679 --> 00:40:17,760
If I were him,

817
00:40:18,159 --> 00:40:20,039
I'd act like nothing happened,

818
00:40:20,039 --> 00:40:21,400
just like an ordinary person.

819
00:40:21,400 --> 00:40:22,679
Anything else gives you away.

820
00:40:23,559 --> 00:40:25,440
Whether being tailed or tested,

821
00:40:25,679 --> 00:40:27,360
the mindset of a spy versus a civilian

822
00:40:27,599 --> 00:40:28,599
is never the same.

823
00:40:34,559 --> 00:40:36,159
Two more traffic lights and he's here.

824
00:40:36,559 --> 00:40:37,440
Countdown.

825
00:40:37,559 --> 00:40:39,400
Turn around at the bend to the alley.

826
00:40:39,599 --> 00:40:40,320
Red light.

827
00:40:40,559 --> 00:40:41,440
Go downstairs now.

828
00:40:41,440 --> 00:40:42,280
Walk over to the curb.

829
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:43,679
You'll run right into him.

830
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:44,800
Find an excuse to stall him.

831
00:40:45,119 --> 00:40:46,119
Two minutes is all it takes.

832
00:40:46,719 --> 00:40:47,119
Got it.

833
00:40:47,119 --> 00:40:48,599
It's best if we can get it signed today.

834
00:40:48,960 --> 00:40:50,000
I should be there

835
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:52,519
in about half an hour.

836
00:40:55,519 --> 00:40:56,280
What the hell?

837
00:40:56,599 --> 00:40:57,880
Watch the red light!

838
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:02,599
What's wrong with you?

839
00:41:03,039 --> 00:41:03,760
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

840
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,159
Spaced out all day long.

841
00:41:20,440 --> 00:41:21,280
Pull over first.

842
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:26,679
Stop.

843
00:41:47,920 --> 00:41:49,119
When you come pick me up every day,

844
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,880
seen the fruit vendor at the intersection?

845
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:53,719
No, I haven't.

846
00:42:19,719 --> 00:42:21,000
Pull out right now. Let's go.

847
00:42:21,760 --> 00:42:22,599
What do we do now?

848
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:23,840
Don't panic.

849
00:42:23,960 --> 00:42:25,239
Our comrades outside are no pushovers.

850
00:42:25,280 --> 00:42:26,079
Hurry up.

851
00:42:26,079 --> 00:42:27,159
Photograph all these books.

852
00:42:29,960 --> 00:42:30,440
Hey, brother.

853
00:42:30,760 --> 00:42:31,280
Hey, brother! Brother!

854
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:32,320
How do I get to Hualin Road?

855
00:42:32,519 --> 00:42:33,480
I don't know! I don't know!

856
00:42:33,480 --> 00:42:33,840
Brother!

857
00:42:38,119 --> 00:42:39,000
Are you crazy?

858
00:42:42,960 --> 00:42:43,519
Coming!

859
00:42:44,760 --> 00:42:45,239
Sorry about this.

860
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:46,159
We're doing construction.

861
00:42:46,159 --> 00:42:47,079
There's live wire inside. It's dangerous!

862
00:42:47,239 --> 00:42:47,760
Dangerous!

863
00:42:49,079 --> 00:42:49,599
Brother Qi.

864
00:42:49,599 --> 00:42:50,320
I photographed all of them.

865
00:42:50,599 --> 00:42:51,239
Let's go.

866
00:42:52,519 --> 00:42:53,039
It's dangerous!

867
00:42:53,119 --> 00:42:53,679
Wait a moment.

868
00:42:53,679 --> 00:42:54,400
Just wait a second.

869
00:43:02,440 --> 00:43:03,000
There's no time!

870
00:43:08,239 --> 00:43:09,239
I'm Peng Yuchang,

871
00:43:09,239 --> 00:43:10,840
inviting you to watch the drama

872
00:43:10,840 --> 00:43:11,679
*Confrontation*.

873
00:43:11,679 --> 00:43:12,480
This contract

874
00:43:12,480 --> 00:43:13,679
must be the final version.

875
00:43:13,679 --> 00:43:15,039
Three seals from the three companies.

876
00:43:15,039 --> 00:43:15,880
Go ahead and stamp it.

877
00:43:15,880 --> 00:43:16,920
Xiazhou,

878
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:17,519
Nanping,

879
00:43:17,519 --> 00:43:18,320
and Tong'an.

880
00:43:18,320 --> 00:43:20,079
The three locations of the missile units.

881
00:43:20,079 --> 00:43:22,039
Did you access his computer's memory card?

882
00:43:22,039 --> 00:43:23,360
This card has been encrypted.

883
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:25,400
Decrypting this card with our current tech

884
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:26,559
will take at least 20 years.

885
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:27,679
What's the matter?

886
00:43:27,679 --> 00:43:29,280
Why are you making a scene so early?

887
00:43:29,280 --> 00:43:30,079
I'm resigning.

888
00:43:30,239 --> 00:43:31,119
I quit!

889
00:43:31,440 --> 00:43:32,800
I should never have come here.

890
00:43:33,239 --> 00:43:34,920
I should never have moved into his home.

891
00:43:35,440 --> 00:43:38,000
I must take him to court!
